ory":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025, and October to November and November to December each came in under 90% of normal in 37 of them. In 2025 on the middle, November to December finished at 46% of normal and July to August at 53%. So far in 2026 on the middle, January to February came in at 44% of normal and February to March at 57%. Grid 16956 had its driest year in 1954 at 64% of normal.</p>"}
